Error [E0205]: Cannot write to `values` — it does not have the write-access marker `&`
  --> plain_parameter_write_take_and_escape_diagnostics_name_explicit_access.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     values[0] = 4
    |           ^^^
 Why: An unmarked parameter gives read access only; assigning into it needs the write-access marker `&`
 Fix: Change the parameter to `values: &[Int]` with the write-access marker `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
